// `Predicate.LegalHostOf` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). "a legal object or player for
// <attachment> to enchant" [CR#303.4f,303.4g].
(
    name: "legalHostOf",
    kinds: [Predicate],
    params: {"attachment": Subject},
    body: LegalHostOf(Param(attachment)),
)
